            "currentUpdate": "The outside procedure log describes removal of a 28-mm ascending-colon adenoma with four overlapping snare captures. All retrieved portions were placed in one container. Pathology calls it one aggregate of tubular adenoma without invasive cancer and notes a free cut edge on one fragment. Endoscopic inspection found no visible remnant. The rest of the colon was completely examined with adequate preparation.",
