                "consequenceNarrative": "The founder reviews the selected plan against the outside record or current clinic findings.",
                "clinicalRationale": "That route was actually retried after recovery and continues to produce vomiting and large aspirates despite the prokinetic; the current record supplies a reason to change access.",
