            "currentUpdate": "A prior low-dose CT showed a left ureteral calculus, and ureteroscopy was scheduled. The calculus was not visible on the accompanying plain film. Pain has since stopped; no fragment was recovered. Current ultrasound shows no dilation but does not depict the ureteral lumen. Pregnancy testing is negative, she is afebrile and creatinine is at baseline.",
